HELP(1)                        User Commands                         HELP(1)

NAME
    help - the command index

SYNOPSIS
    help [TOPIC]

DESCRIPTION
    With no TOPIC, print the commands grouped by what they do. With one,
    print a short note on a command or a group (files, security, process,
    ipc, loader). For a full page use man(1).

SEE ALSO
    man(1), apropos(1)
